id: keyboard-arbitration
section: Keyboard and text
item: Keyboard arbitration on the card side (the 2026-08-15 procedure, with the emulated hardware keyboard): a movie engaged by its first tap takes a hardware key and the address field's pixels do not change; released, a tap on the address field takes the next key (its pixels change)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2&over=1
kit: cavekit-input-bridging.md R7
fixture: kernel-kbd
wait text ready stage= 30
sample bar 150,30,620,78
flash-tap m 400 300 showAll 200 150
expect number n-down 1 1
pause 800
kernel-key 30
wait text keydown "keydown 65 97" 5
expect region-equal 150,30,620,78 bar
tap-at 650 800
pause 800
chrome address
expect keyboard up
pause 1000
kernel-key 30
wait settled 4
expect region-changed 150,30,620,78 bar
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down
